  "reasoning": "The defendant Feng (冯某) knowingly facilitated the sale of a woman (陈某) who had been abducted and was being held as a wife. He introduced buyers and attempted to sell her for a price, which constitutes the crime of trafficking a woman under Article 240 of the Criminal Law. No other elements such as sexual exploitation, forced labor, or illegal detention are present, so the appropriate charge is solely \"拐卖妇女罪\".",
